Dialogue: 5,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell the class your name?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:06.73,0:00:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm... I-I'm Akemi Homura...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:11.49,0:00:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh... I-It's nice to meet all of you.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.83,0:00:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Akemi{*}-san{*}'s been in hospital for some time due to a heart condition.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:23.25,0:00:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She hasn't been to school in quite a while,\N so I'm sure she'll run into a lot of difficulties.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:27.75,0:00:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you all help her out, okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:31.43,0:00:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Which school did you come from?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:34.73,0:00:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you in any clubs?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:36.43,0:00:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Like sports, or art?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:38.02,0:00:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hair's really long.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:40.12,0:00:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be tough braiding it every morning.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:42.25,0:00:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:46.83,0:00:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Akemi{*}-san{*}, you need to go\N to the nurse's office, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.11,0:00:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where it is?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:52.43,0:00:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:53.36,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:54.24,0:00:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you there, then.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:56.39,0:00:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the health officer for this class.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:58.37,0:01:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, everyone,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:00.12,0:01:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but Akemi{*}-san{*} has to go to the nurse's office during recess to take her medicine.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Sorry for keeping you.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:08.81,0:01:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk to you later, Akemi{*}-san{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:14.41,0:01:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:15.81,0:01:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't mean any harm.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:17.63,0:01:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just excited because we don't get many transfer students.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:21.18,0:01:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:23.35,0:01:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:25.26,0:01:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't be so nervous.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.27,0:01:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're classmates, after all.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:29.27,0:01:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Kaname Madoka.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:31.52,0:01:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me Madoka.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:34.63,0:01:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:35.65,0:01:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, really.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:37.11,0:01:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I call you Homura{*}-chan{*}?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:41.81,0:01:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,People don't call me by my first name very often.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:47.02,0:01:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a really weird name.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:49.53,0:01:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What? That's not true.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:52.26,0:01:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels really exciting and cool.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:58.08,0:01:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I don't live up to my own name.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:01.22,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't say that!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:03.60,0:02:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You already have such\N a wonderful name.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:06.02,0:02:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be cool to match it!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:14.41,0:02:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, why don't you\N try solving this one?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:24.02,0:02:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've been away\N from school, haven't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:27.68,0:02:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you ask a friend\Nto let you copy their notes?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:30.87,0:02:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She got light-headed just from doing warm-ups? That's pretty bad.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:33.92,0:02:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been bedridden for half a year.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:36.34,0:02:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no surprise.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:42.09,0:02:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You should be cool to match it!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:46.67,0:02:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't do that. I'm not good at anything.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:51.89,0:02:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All I ever do is make trouble for others and embarrass myself.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:56.97,0:02:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:59.30,0:03:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will I always be like this... forever?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:04.84,0:03:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It'd be better if you just\Ndied right now, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:08.39,0:03:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe it would.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:10.50,0:03:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah. You should just die right now.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:14.42,0:03:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should just... die...
Dialogue: 5,0:03:25.48,0:03:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Where... am I?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.83,0:03:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:36.61,0:03:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:40.75,0:03:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:57.35,0:03:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:59.61,0:04:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay now, Homura{*}-chan{*}!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:02.30,0:04:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-You're...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:04.99,0:04:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They're magical girls.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:07.30,0:04:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They hunt witches.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:09.31,0:04:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our secret didn't last very long, huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:11.68,0:04:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone else in class, okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:29.33,0:04:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaname{*}-san{*}, do you always fight those things?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:33.58,0:04:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Always? Well, Mami{*}-san{*}'s the veteran here.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:38.94,0:04:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually just made my contract\N with Kyubey last week.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:42.95,0:04:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But your performance today was a big\Nimprovement over before, Kaname{*}-san{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.29,0:04:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it dangerous? You're not scared?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:53.48,0:04:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it certainly is dangerous,\N and we do get scared,
Dialogue: 5,0:04:57.96,0:05:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but the more witches we defeat, \Nthe more people we can save.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:02.28,0:05:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's worth it, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:06.19,0:05:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We need Kaname{*}-san{*} to become a full-fledged\N magical girl before the Walpurgisnacht gets here.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:18.58,0:05:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be going, then.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:21.56,0:05:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:22.88,0:05:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But Tomoe{*}-san{*} just died.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:26.55,0:05:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I have to go.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:28.02,0:05:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one left who\Ncan stop the Walpurgisnacht.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:32.64,0:05:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's impossible! Nobody\N could fight that thing alone!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:36.96,0:05:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll die too, Kaname{*}-san{*}!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:39.01,0:05:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still a magical girl.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:42.65,0:05:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to protect everyone.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:46.84,0:05:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please... let's just run away.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:50.18,0:05:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else we can do.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:52.99,0:05:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No one would ever blame you.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:57.77,0:06:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{*}-chan{*}, I'm really glad we became friends.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:03.83,0:06:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Even now, the fact that we made it in time to save you from that witch
Dialogue: 5,0:06:07.49,0:06:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,is one of my proudest accomplishments.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:10.43,0:06:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm glad I became a magical girl.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:15.72,0:06:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't regret it at all.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:18.37,0:06:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaname{*}-san{*}...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:19.77,0:06:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Homura{*}-chan{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:23.78,0:06:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:25.90,0:06:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Don't go, Kaname{*}-san{*}!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:36.33,0:06:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:38.39,0:06:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew you were going to die.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:41.50,0:06:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you could have lived...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:47.43,0:06:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,instead of saving someone like me...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:50.07,0:06:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you truly mean those\Nwords, Akemi Homura?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:54.44,0:06:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you be willing to trade\N your soul for that wish?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:58.27,0:07:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something you want badly enough\Nto commit yourself to a life of battle, then...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:03.27,0:07:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can be of help to you.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:08.72,0:07:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I make a contract with you, \Ncan you really grant any wish I want?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:13.06,0:07:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:14.73,0:07:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that you qualify.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:17.04,0:07:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tell me, what is the wish that will make your Soul Gem shine?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:22.79,0:07:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:32.55,0:07:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to redo my first\Nencounter with Kaname{*}-san{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:37.45,0:07:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time, instead of\N her protecting me,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:39.81,0:07:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to become strong\N enough to protect her!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:55.07,0:07:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The contract has been made.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:57.09,0:07:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wish has prevailed over entropy.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:00.19,0:08:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, release your new power!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:30.70,0:08:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:33.87,0:08:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still in the hospital?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:43.86,0:08:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a dream!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:49.99,0:08:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell the class your name?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:52.90,0:08:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Akemi Homura.\NNice to meet you all!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:57.01,0:09:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Akemi{*}-san{*}'s been in hospital for some—
Dialogue: 5,0:09:02.85,0:09:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaname{*}-san{*}, I became a magical girl too!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:06.23,0:09:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's do our best together from now on!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:08.44,0:09:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:15.36,0:09:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:41.14,0:09:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Mami{*}-san{*}?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:45.63,0:09:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Time magic, huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:47.94,0:09:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty amazing,\N but you're not using it right.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:52.64,0:09:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:22.55,0:10:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami{*}-san{*}, now's our chance!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:24.51,0:10:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:34.32,0:10:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Akemi{*}-san{*}, your turn!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:36.11,0:10:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:06.19,0:11:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:07.94,0:11:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:09.48,0:11:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:12.39,0:11:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:12.39,0:11:13.23,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:13.23,0:11:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Homura{*}-chan{*}!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:23.95,0:11:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:25.27,0:11:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaname{*}-san{*}! Hang on!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:28.96,0:11:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:42.72,0:11:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:46.51,0:11:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:48.70,0:11:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:01.20,0:12:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to warn them.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:02.40,0:12:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We've all been fooled by Kyubey!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:05.74,0:12:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what would Kyubey gain by lying about something like that?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:11.26,0:12:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:12.24,0:12:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to turn us against each other or something?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:16.13,0:12:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're not working together with that Kyouko girl, are you?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:20.63,0:12:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:22.20,0:12:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{*}-chan{*}, now you're the one who's turning us against each other.{timing fix}
Dialogue: 5,0:12:26.21,0:12:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm against teaming up with her.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:29.93,0:12:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami{*}-san{*} and Madoka use \Nlong-range weapons, so they're fine,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:33.33,0:12:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but I fight up close, and having bombs go off in my face is something I can live without.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:37.79,0:12:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How many's it gonna take\Nbefore I get blown up too?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:40.82,0:12:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Akemi{*}-san{*}, do you have any other weapons besides explosives?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:47.98,0:12:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll think of something.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:14.18,0:13:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:16.67,0:13:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done with Sayaka?!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:18.84,0:13:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{*}-chan{*}, stop it!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:20.62,0:13:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please remember!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:22.95,0:13:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you never wanted to hurt anyone!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:44.84,0:13:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Miki{*}-san{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:02.06,0:14:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka... Damn it...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:05.18,0:14:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:06.57,0:14:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:09.16,0:14:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too much.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:19.06,0:14:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoe{*}-san{*}?!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:22.08,0:14:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Soul Gems give birth to witches...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:25.35,0:14:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,then we have no choice but to die!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:27.84,0:14:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You, me, all of us!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:30.05,0:14:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:39.88,0:14:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:42.13,0:14:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take this any more!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:50.98,0:14:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:52.94,0:14:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do this together.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:54.68,0:14:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll beat the Walpurgisnacht,\N just the two of us!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:01.30,0:15:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.13,0:15:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess... this is the end for us too.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:18.23,0:15:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any Grief Seeds?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:24.11,0:15:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:25.64,0:15:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... How about we become monsters together...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:31.21,0:15:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and lay waste to this awful world?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:35.28,0:15:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll wipe out everything...\N all traces of evil or sadness...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:41.57,0:15:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and just destroy, destroy, destroy... \Nuntil there's nothing left but dust.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:46.29,0:15:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think... that sounds nice?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:57.29,0:15:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I lied before.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:59.44,0:16:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I had one left.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:01.41,0:16:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:02.77,0:16:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you use it on me?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:04.36,0:16:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I need you to do something I can't.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:10.61,0:16:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can travel back in time, right, Homura{*}-chan{*}?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:15.11,0:16:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You can change history so it doesn't end like this, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:21.12,0:16:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:22.22,0:16:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you save me from my stupidity...\Nbefore I get fooled by Kyubey?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:29.92,0:16:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:31.94,0:16:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save you, no matter what.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:34.43,0:16:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times I have to try,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:36.93,0:16:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I will protect you!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.26,0:16:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:50.19,0:16:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I ask you... for one more thing?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:54.39,0:16:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:56.50,0:16:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to become a witch.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:00.24,0:17:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many awful, sad things in this world...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:03.95,0:17:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but there are lots of things... \Nworth protecting... too...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:09.96,0:17:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:12.48,0:17:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{*}-chan{*}...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:14.05,0:17:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally called me by my first name...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:17.00,0:17:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:40.32,0:17:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No one will believe the future.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:44.41,0:17:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No one can accept the future.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:49.67,0:17:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So I will...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:54.59,0:17:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who's there?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:56.79,0:18:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, if someone should ever appear before you, promising you a miracle,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:02.60,0:18:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,you must not succumb to temptation.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:05.10,0:18:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:06.24,0:18:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:15.86,0:18:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will never depend on anyone again.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:19.63,0:18:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will never need anyone\Nto understand me again.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:29.80,0:18:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will never let Madoka fight again.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:35.63,0:18:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will destroy all the witches by myself.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:43.14,0:18:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And this time, I will stop the \NWalpurgisnacht with my own hands.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:09.96,0:19:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How awful!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:11.20,0:19:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:12.47,0:19:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too much for her to handle alone.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:14.71,0:19:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is terrible! It shouldn't be happening!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:22.76,0:19:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, don't listen to him!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:29.25,0:19:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over if you give up.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:31.60,0:19:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have the ability to change fate.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:34.73,0:19:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This unavoidable destruction and sorrow...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:37.87,0:19:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can change it all.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:40.32,0:19:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the power to do just that.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:44.25,0:19:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I really?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:45.62,0:19:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be fooled! You're falling right into his trap!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:49.24,0:19:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I really do something to stop all of this?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:52.99,0:19:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I really change this ending?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:55.26,0:19:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you can!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:57.16,0:19:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So, make a contract with me...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:59.59,0:20:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and become a magical girl!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:07.39,0:20:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1500)}No!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:16.72,0:20:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka really was amazing when she transformed, wasn't she?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:22.34,0:20:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I had predicted she'd become the most powerful magical girl,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:27.58,0:20:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but I never would have imagined she'd \Ndestroy the Walpurgisnacht with just one shot.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:33.34,0:20:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And did you know what would happen to her as a result?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:37.33,0:20:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It would've happened sooner or later.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:41.06,0:20:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As the strongest magical girl,\N she took down her greatest enemy.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:46.58,0:20:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, after that, all that was left was for her to become the most terrible witch.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:50.19,0:20:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,In this form, I imagine it will only take her\Naround ten days to destroy the entire planet.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:56.81,0:21:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. What happens next is mankind's problem, not ours.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:00.57,0:21:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We've pretty much met our\Nenergy quota at this point.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:10.28,0:21:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to fight her?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:12.42,0:21:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:14.31,0:21:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not my battlefield.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:18.12,0:21:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Akemi Homura, are you...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:24.50,0:21:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll do it over...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:25.80,0:21:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}as many times as it takes.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:34.68,0:21:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll relive the same time over and over, \Nsearching for the one way out.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:39.81,0:21:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll find the one path that will save you from your fate of boundless despair.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:58.71,0:22:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Madoka... my one and only friend.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:05.98,0:22:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{*}-chan{*}?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:15.02,0:22:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If it's... If it's for you,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:19.55,0:22:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't mind being trapped in this endless maze...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:22.48,0:22:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for all eternity!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.99,0:22:26.03,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Credits}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.00,0:23:56.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:57.26,0:24:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}Did you really feel nothing while watching over those girls this whole time?
Dialogue: 5,0:24:02.07,0:24:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}Didn't you at least try to understand how much they were suffering?
Dialogue: 5,0:24:07.19,0:24:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}The one thing I have left to guide me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.94,0:23:04.73,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I'll walk upon this Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.73,0:23:06.80,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}and pierce this shadowy veil of unease,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:10.41,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}as many times as necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.55,0:23:31.86,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}with these unwavering feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.71,0:23:47.52,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}the beautiful blue sky will always be waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.30,0:22:29.70,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,0)}I'll never forget the promises we exchanged
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.70,0:22:32.18,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I still see it when I close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.18,0:22:33.80,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I'll move forward as I cast off
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:37.68,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}this darkness engulfing me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.96,0:22:53.79,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,480)}How long will it be before
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.79,0:22:59.94,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I see that lost future again?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.52,0:23:49.84,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}So I won't be afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.84,0:23:55.99,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,1020)}No matter what happens next, I won't give in
